algeria-geo-laravel: notices
============================

Code
----
The package code started from kossa/algerian-cities (MIT).
See licenses/kossa-algerian-cities-LICENSE.md.

Data in data/
-------------
- Wilayas, dairas, communes, postal codes and most coordinates come from
  test-bit-sys/algeria-geo (MIT). See licenses/algeria-geo-LICENSE and the
  original notice below.
- Some commune spellings, the wilaya capitals and the Algiers commune groups
  come from yasserstudio/geoalgeria (MIT). See licenses/geoalgeria-LICENSE.
- Algiers groups in dairas.json are legally "circonscriptions administratives"
  (presidential decree 26-112 of 8 March 2026), not dairas.
- Region assignments were chosen by the package author.

OpenStreetMap coordinates were removed
--------------------------------------
This package does not include the 323 OpenStreetMap-derived commune
coordinates described in section 3 of the notice below, or the boundary files
described in section 4. The 323 coordinates were replaced with:
- 311 values from Wikidata property P625 (CC0 1.0)
- 12 values from kossa/algerian-cities (MIT)

Wilaya coordinates are the coordinates of each wilaya's capital commune.

